<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1020', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', padding: '52px 60px 30px 60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4D8DFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2.2 }}>04 · 基准</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8 }}>
        三个基准，各承担一个假设
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#24334C', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 1128, marginTop: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#16233A', padding: '12px 16px' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 160, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>基准</Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 470, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>本文用到的任务</Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 350, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>评估协议</Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 148, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>承担</Text>
        </Box>
        {[
            ['PolyBench', ['6 个主表任务：Tg、Tm、模量、渗透率、', '介电损耗、IWLT'], '固定 70/30 × 3 个种子', 'H1'],
            ['PB26', ['2 个任务：PolyMetriX Tg、均聚物密度', '+ 官方架构迁移'], '官方 5 折，seed 42', 'H2、H1 架构'],
            ['OpenPoly', ['3 个性质：Tg、Tm、介电常数'], '5 折 × 3 种子 × 5 个 n 档', 'H3、H4'],
        ].map(([name, lines, protocol, owns]) => (
            <Box key={name} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', padding: '13px 16px', background: '#0E1728', borderBottom: '1px solid #1D2A40' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 160, fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4D8DFF' }}>{name}</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 470, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    {lines.map((line) => (
                        <Text key={line} style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>{line}</Text>
                    ))}
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ width: 350, fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>{protocol}</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 148, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{owns}</Text>
            </Box>
        ))}
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44, marginTop: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 470, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#93A8C2', letterSpacing: 1.4, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>POLYBENCH 自己的三层划分</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 470, marginTop: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#16233A', padding: '9px 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ width: 60, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>层号</Text>
                    <Text style={{ width: 210, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>任务</Text>
                    <Text style={{ width: 172, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>标注行数</Text>
                </Box>
                {[
                    ['1', 'Tg、Tm', '8,055 / 3,796'],
                    ['2', '模量、渗透率', '1,034 / 711'],
                    ['3', '介电损耗、IWLT', '279 / 228'],
                ].map(([t, tasks, rows]) => (
                    <Box key={t} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', padding: '10px 14px', background: '#0E1728', borderBottom: '1px solid #1D2A40' }}>
                        <Text style={{ width: 60, fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2' }}>{t}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ width: 210, fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2' }}>{tasks}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ width: 172, fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2' }}>{rows}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFB020', lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                这里层号和样本量几乎是同一个变量：ρ = −0.956。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                所以一个层号同时代理了两件事 ——「需要链信息」和「数据少 30 倍」。这句话在分层出现的这一页就说，
                不等讨论时再补。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 'auto' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 980, gap: 2 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8FA3BC', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                H1 架构子句（同一行；RMSE，越低越容易）：OOD 档 random 0.478 &lt; block 0.526 —— block 是更难的划分，这正是我们预期的。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8FA3BC', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                ID 档 alternating 0.110 &lt; homopolymer 0.395 —— 均聚更难，与预期相反。两者不同域，只陈述、不判决。
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>5 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
